{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16224130","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16224130","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1622413001:1":{"text":"这杯热奶让我暖和多了，就像躺在正午的日光石上一样舒服，这才是生活该有的温度！感谢招待！","source_cn":"这杯热奶让我暖和多了，就像躺在正午的日光石上一样舒服，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31456823BDC20698","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1622413002:1":{"text":"听说莱希拉姆学院有位蛮血老师，在这边的确不常见，所以我刚才一下就认出来了。","source_cn":"听说莱希拉姆学院有位蛮血老师，在这边的确不常见，所以我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x333709180057B82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1622413003:1":{"text":"是吗？看来科丝蒂提起过我。","source_cn":"是吗？看来科丝蒂提起过我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA346004D14A54805","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1622413004:1":{"text":"是啊，那孩子非常喜欢莱希拉姆，学院里的事总爱挂在嘴边。不过……唉……","source_cn":"是啊，那孩子非常喜欢莱希拉姆，学院里的事总爱挂在嘴边。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD979186DB82A9695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1622413004":{"text":"是啊，那孩子非常喜欢莱希拉姆，学院里的事总爱挂在嘴边。不过……唉……","source_cn":"是啊，那孩子非常喜欢莱希拉姆，学院里的事总爱挂在嘴边。不过……唉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD979186DB82A9695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1622413005:1":{"text":"其实……趁科丝蒂不在，我有些话想说。","source_cn":"其实……趁科丝蒂不在，我有些话想说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F7A8EF733132CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1622413006:1":{"text":"尽管开口，女士。","source_cn":"尽管开口，女士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1A4325920FB938F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1622413007:1":{"text":"是科丝蒂最近被选为宫廷魔法师的事。","source_cn":"是科丝蒂最近被选为宫廷魔法师的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C1E4E04D6B4D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1622413008:1":{"text":"作为她的妈妈，我当然为她骄傲，可一想到她要独自去赛凡纳，心里就不踏实……","source_cn":"作为她的妈妈，我当然为她骄傲，可一想到她要独自去赛凡纳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE4497802B84346B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622413009:1":{"text":"宫廷那种地方，不光看学问，还要明白人情世故，懂察言观色。","source_cn":"宫廷那种地方，不光看学问，还要明白人情世故，懂察言观色。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE8D3A2176AAC293","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1622413010:1":{"text":"可科丝蒂她……唉，你们也知道……","source_cn":"可科丝蒂她……唉，你们也知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB862AEF24A92599F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1622413010":{"text":"可科丝蒂她……唉，你们也知道……","source_cn":"可科丝蒂她……唉，你们也知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB862AEF24A92599F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1622413011:1":{"text":"唉，里尔斯也常这样安慰我，可我还是放心不下……","source_cn":"唉，里尔斯也常这样安慰我，可我还是放心不下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4312097BE5745B00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1622413013:1":{"text":"我怕她在那种复杂的环境里吃亏。她连最基本的客套话都不会说，更别提那些弯弯绕绕的宫廷规矩了。","source_cn":"我怕她在那种复杂的环境里吃亏。她连最基本的客套话都不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x870EC821D7948F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1622413014:1":{"text":"我理解你的担忧，父母总想为孩子挡住所有风雨。","source_cn":"我理解你的担忧，父母总想为孩子挡住所有风雨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EFA6CEEC2C4228D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1622413015:1":{"text":"不过，说起适应新环境这件事，我倒是有些经历可以分享。","source_cn":"不过，说起适应新环境这件事，我倒是有些经历可以分享。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE1A1CB241055BC2","variant_st